# Specialised root modules — shared guidance for a recurring creator group or situation
# that goes beyond one active flow.
#
# Empty on purpose: none has been authored. The directory exists because CODEOWNERS
# already governs it as its own approval tier (new specialised root module), and because
# @resonance/core names `specialized_root_module` as a corpus file type. A module dropped
# here needs a body schema in `@resonance/core`'s CorpusFileSchema union first — that
# union deliberately has no entry for it yet.
